<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="classBpReceiveFile" kindref="compound">BpReceiveFile</ref> class is a child class of <ref refid="classBpSinkPattern" kindref="compound">BpSinkPattern</ref>. It is an app used for receiving file-fragment bundles from the <ref refid="classBpSendFile" kindref="compound">BpSendFile</ref> app and writing those files to disk within a directory and preserving the sender&apos;s relative path names. This app is intended to be used with the <ref refid="classBpSendFile" kindref="compound">BpSendFile</ref> app. It is acceptable if the bundles arrive out-of-order. </para>
</sect1>
